{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"高阶可表现范畴"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"高阶可表现范畴"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>高阶可表现范畴又称可表现 $(\\infty ,n)$-范畴, 是"},{"Local":{"url":"可表现范畴","text":"可表现范畴"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>粗略地说 (忽略所有基数大小问题), 高阶可表现范畴的定义是 “取模范畴” 操作的迭代.\n对于可表现"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal M$, 可定义其 (在余完备范畴的范畴 $\\mathsf{Cat}_{\\mathrm{cocomp}}$ 中的) “模范畴” $\\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathcal M)$. “可表现 $n$-范畴的范畴” $n\\mathsf{Pr}$ 由下式归纳定义:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$1\\mathsf{Pr} = \\mathsf{Mod}(\\mathsf{Ani}) = \\mathsf{Pr}$,</li>\n<li>$n\\mathsf{Pr} = \\mathsf{Mod}((n-1)\\mathsf{Pr})$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>按上述方法定义的范畴 $n\\mathsf{Pr}$ 是 $(\\infty ,1)$-范畴, 但可以升级为 $(\\infty ,n+1)$-范畴, 参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"StefanichHigherQCoh","text":"Stefanich"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}